1. ./build.sh v1
2. ./push_to_artifactory.sh v1
3. Change src/app.py:
return {"ok": "v1"} -> return {"ok": "v2"}

4. ./build.sh v2
5. ./push_to_artifactory.sh v2

6. ./install.sh v1
7. ./install.sh v2

8. kubectl get service

9. Enter to pod and check services with curl:
kubectl run curl-test --image=curlimages/curl -it --rm -- sh
> curl http://<SERVICE-1-IP>
> curl http://<SERVICE-2-IP>

10. Apply gateway
cd gatewayclass
./apply-gateway.sh 

11. kubectl get gateway
Example:
NAME              CLASS                            ADDRESS         PROGRAMMED   AGE
uvicorn-gateway   gke-l7-global-external-managed   136.69.22.221   True         103s

12. Apply httprouter
./apply-httprouter.sh

13. kubectl describe httproute uvicorn-route

14. cd gatewayclass/testing
./distribute.sh <GATEWAY_IP>

15. Check results
Example:
91 {"ok":"v1"}
9 {"ok":"v2"}
